OL,3,GNEWSAMisconduct probe after police
OL,4,Aofficer admits abusing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving police officer has been
OL,7,Fordered to carry out unpaid work for
OL,8,Fabusive offences against a woman.
OL,10,FJay Skivington, 24, of Aberdeen,
OL,11,Fpreviously admitted a course of abusive
OL,12,Fbehaviour.
OL,14,FHe was sentenced to 160 hours of unpaid
OL,15,Fwork at Aberdeen Sheriff Court on
OL,16,FWednesday, and given a five-year
OL,17,Fnon-harassment order in respect of the
OL,18,Fvictim.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
